}},{"title":"和答守之","author":"钱时","text":"除却周人孰与归，纷纷装点入时宜。\n豳风七月今谁嗣，不补君王不是诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61807,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂虹","author":"钱时","text":"不到垂虹十四秋，聊倾卮酒酹沙鸥。\n蹄涔一勺閒风月，老眼关河万国愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61808,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜观汝溪二侄象棋四首 其四","author":"钱时","text":"怡怡夜语自天和，棋罢令人感慨多。\n同室不须分楚越，萧墙何事动干戈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61809,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜观汝溪二侄象棋四首 其三","author":"钱时","text":"伏险藏机深复深，旁观袖手独沉吟。\n忍将局上閒棋子，碍却怡怡兄弟心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61810,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜观汝溪二侄象棋四首 其二","author":"钱时","text":"覆雨翻云着一争，分明死地要求生。\n如何自有转身路，苦向人间险处行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61811,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜观汝溪二侄象棋四首 其一","author":"钱时","text":"对河车马夜枰棋，活路经营尽入思。\n虑患谋身每如许，不应容易落便宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61812,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜索熟水甘甚","author":"钱时","text":"呼童夜半一杯汤，盎盎天和入肺肠。\n咽正滑时即挥去，人间此意细思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61813,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岿然亭","author":"钱时","text":"西山紫翠入层霄，老木尘风万窍号。\n会得此时亭上意，巍然非下亦非高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61814,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怪松","author":"钱时","text":"老木樛枝著地垂，交拿互攫挂虬螭。\n何如头角峥嵘起，直节凌霄愈更奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61815,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕上二首 其二","author":"钱时","text":"自心有过有谁知，看此初萌一念时。\n一念不分真与妄，十分伶俐十分痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61816,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕上二首 其一","author":"钱时","text":"勿言暗室暗沉沉，降陟无非上帝临。\n瞒得世间人不见，直须瞒得自家心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61817,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"治径","author":"钱时","text":"草迷三径绿芊芊，可是山翁懒得便。\n直自酴醾花去后，不曾行到大门前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61818,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊无碍定庵二首 其二","author":"钱时","text":"十七年前到定庵，老僧朝暮拜瞿昙。\n如今谁是香花主，老木号风暮正酣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61819,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊无碍定庵二首 其一","author":"钱时","text":"定庵回首几春风，坏砌颓檐咽暮钟。\n惟有窗间双月桂，花开还似旧时红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61820,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊桐步","author":"钱时","text":"一枕寒江浪拍天，更添急霰打船舷。\n人间有底风波恶，不废山翁夜熟眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61821,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊嘉禾","author":"钱时","text":"山翁尽惯卧山云，夜漏无声梦境平。\n舟近谯楼眠不稳，却嫌更点太分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61822,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎邱遍观题壁","author":"钱时","text":"莫嗔鱼目混摩尼，著目从头亦自奇。\n但向壁间时得句，老夫不用更题诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61823,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣城琴高之名甚著转送四方甚珍品也比得之乃乡间桐鱼耳一笑而赋二首 其二","author":"钱时","text":"大药真成九灶火，小鲜何事一杯羹。\n终然不免名为累，岁岁琴高入鼎烹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61824,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣城琴高之名甚著转送四方甚珍品也比得之乃乡间桐鱼耳一笑而赋二首 其一","author":"钱时","text":"春网琴高长藋茅，宣城风物剩浮誇。\n蜀溪岁岁桐鱼上，堪恨无人唤药查。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61825,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚缓步卧龙始尽见此山全体","author":"钱时","text":"老眼山林自是宜，卧龙春晚夕阳迟。\n芒鞋竹杖经行遍，绝胜篮舆喝道时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61826,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洗竹","author":"钱时","text":"满地槐花有底忙，我无题目可商量。\n呼童遍洗庭前竹，冷眼相看到雪霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61827,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"盆梅倒植刳朽根作古怪僧复接杏花其上小诗吊之","author":"钱时","text":"倒植盘梅已反常，无端更接杏花芳。\n东君可是能时样，姑射山人也艳妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61828,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看花","author":"钱时","text":"兰畹梅林事未阑，瑞香那复夜团团。\n东君动是经年别，每到花开仔细看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61829,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻子居近况","author":"钱时","text":"十里溪山别两年，忽闻消息为欣然。\n把书檐下往来看，不觉人行到面前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61830,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除日暮放鲫鱼于月池者九夜再得六复秉烛放之偶合阴阳老数成一绝","author":"钱时","text":"除夕生鱼有异逢，挑灯两度散春风。\n莫言九六无心得，须信乾坤一念中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61831,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"顺堂夜雨","author":"钱时","text":"海棠初绽锦成林，多少人间富贵心。\n隽永一灯论语课，萧萧风雨夜堂深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61832,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饶氏石井二首 其二","author":"钱时","text":"井边高下拥衡茅，问着人家尽姓饶。\n解道银青是吾相，编篱拉刺手如骹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61833,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饶氏石井二首 其一","author":"钱时","text":"紫溪镇遏旧朱门，满地芃芃欲断魂。\n当日告身今故纸，独遗眢井付诸孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":61834,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]